-- knight.talk: the knight piece's Script, part of the pass-up-the-message-path
-- case (ADR 0031). It vetoes only its own squares, and hands the rest of the
-- Verdict up to the board with `pass`.

script variable own = ["d4", "e5"]

on beforeMove m, deciding
  if the to of m is in own then veto "Your own piece is on that square."
  pass beforeMove                  -- let the board have its say
end beforeMove
